          "id": "tts-8-2053",
          "type": "tts",
          "title": "Lecture 1",
          "text": "Meet the Carter family! They live in York, in the north of England.Mr Carter is a geography teacher and Mrs Carter is a nurse.They get up at 6:30 am and the children get up at 7:00 am. They have breakfast at 7:30 am.Danny and Beth eat cereal and toast. They don’t drink coffee or tea, but they drink orangejuice.Alfie the dog and Sybil the cat have breakfast, too. Do the parrots, Eric and Ernie, eat breakfastin the morning? No, they don’t. They sleep! They are lazy, funny birds.",
