          "id": "tts-16-0877",
          "type": "tts",
          "title": "Lecture 1",
          "text": "When the family goes out, thepets play. Sybil the cat runsacross the living room. Alfiethe dog, chases her. She hidesunder the sofa. She doesn’twant to play. He jumps ontothe sofa. He watches her andhe waits. He doesn’t catch herbecause Sybil is too fast andtoo clever.Eric and Ernie, the parrots, siton the back of a large armchair.They don’t sleep. They watchTV and they talk. Eric likessport on TV. He loves football,but he doesn’t like rugby. Heshouts, “Goal! Goal!” Ernielikes cooking programmes.He loves shows about baking.He likes pancakes but hedoesn’t like waffles. He says,“Pancakes?” “Yes, please!”and “Waffles? Ugh! No, thankyou!”",
