        {
          "id": "tts-32-1445",
          "type": "tts",
          "title": "Lecture 1",
          "text": "The Carter family’s pets have a secret. Alfie, Sybil, Eric and Ernie are special helpers! Theyare the Action Pets! They always help people and the Carters do not know about it. Noone knows about it.One Tuesday morning Eric flies to the window. “Does anyone need help today?” he asks.“Yes!” shouts Ernie. “Mrs Green always walks to the shops on Tuesday, but today shedoesn’t feel well. And her cat is stuck up on a tree!”Alfie runs so fast that he almost flies! He takes the small gardentrampoline as a safety net for the cat. Sybil usually stays at homeand sleeps, but today she climbs the tree and rescues Mrs Green’scat. Now the two cats are best friends!Eric and Ernie go to the shops and collect hershopping. They fly with the bags in their beaks, but an egg falls!Ernie catches it with his feet. “I never drop eggs!” he says.Mrs Green opens her door. “How does myshopping always get here when I feel unwell?”she asks. The pets smile and go home. She doesn’t see them. TheCarters do not see them get back in the house. No one sees them.Do the Carters know about the Action Pets?No, they don’t! When the family has breakfastat 7:30 am, Alfie wants his breakfast as always, and Sybil sleeps asusual. The parrots look out of the window. Mrs Green is surprisedand happy. Her cat is happy, too.",
